==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~26.67 seconds<sup>200f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 12~48 seconds<sup>360f~1,440f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~80 seconds<sup>600f~2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 25.33~101.33 seconds<sup>760f~3,040f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Deploy a bunch of [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] to rush the level.

